@startuml m3-artifact-lifecycle
title Architecture revision lifecycle
[*] --> CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED : analyze (questions)
[*] --> DRAFT : generate
CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED --> DRAFT : answer / defer + generate
DRAFT --> DRAFT : save / revise / quality (new immutable revision)
DRAFT --> UNDER_REVIEW : submit(revision, hash)
UNDER_REVIEW --> APPROVED : human approve
UNDER_REVIEW --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : human request changes
UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : human reject
CHANGES_REQUESTED --> DRAFT : new revision required
REJECTED --> DRAFT : new revision required
APPROVED --> DRAFT : revise / rebase (baseline retained)
note right of APPROVED : immutable baseline\nconsumable by future agents
@enduml
